# Only what the image is built from goes into the build context. Above all, no configuration
# file or key file: they hold secrets (DD-059) and are mounted at run time, never built in.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!backend/
!frontend/
# The build needs no YAML file; any there may be a configuration file holding secrets.
**/*.yaml
**/*.yml
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.env
**/.env.*
